  "project_description": "A simple module that adds CSS to make Moderation Sidebar toolbar tab work well with Gin Admin Theme / Gin Toolbar .\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n Gin-inspired colors for Moderation Sidebar's toolbar tab (Published, Draft and Draft Available). \n Two tab color schemes—default and high contrast. \n Support for Gin dark and high contrast modes. \n Adds a \"Gin-style\" icon for the Moderation Sidebar toolbar tab.\n Works with all Gin toolbar settings (Vertical, Horizontal, Classic). \n \n Back to top \n\n Additional Requirements \n \n Moderation Sidebar \n Gin Admin Theme \n Gin Toolbar \n Back to top",
